// "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control."
// [CR#701.14a]: the rules instruct the first creature, so the spell hands it
// the action; each target is selected once, though the fight body mentions
// the other creature three times.
SingleFaced(face: (
    characteristics: (
        name: "Prey Upon",
        cost: [Green],
        types: [Sorcery],
        text: [
            spell(
                act(target(creatureYouControl), fight(target(creatureYouDontControl))),
            ),
        ],
    ),
))
